# A message that did not go, deleted (删除): gone from the chat, and the station never has it.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
wait 1000
log do: freeze
wait 2000
tap 发消息
type 这条没发出去就删掉 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
timeout 180000
until 未发送
shot 1-unsent
timeout 60000
tap =删除
gone 这条没发出去就删掉 {T}
shot 2-deleted
log do: thaw
wait 10000
gone 这条没发出去就删掉 {T}
shot 3-after-thaw
